---
/**
 * Campaign: Premier League and FA — rebuilt on the design system.
 * Doesn't fit CampaignTemplate (no petition of its own — its CTA is a
 * generic "join us" ask, and there's no stats/timeline/demands content),
 * so this is a lightweight standalone page reusing the same primitives.
 * Real content preserved verbatim — see .bak-pre-step2 for the original.
 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/design-system/Header.astro';
import SplitHero from '../../components/design-system/SplitHero.astro';
import Section from '../../components/design-system/Section.astro';
import Headline from '../../components/design-system/Headline.astro';
import Label from '../../components/design-system/Label.astro';
import Button from '../../components/design-system/Button.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/design-system/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout
  headHtml=""
  title="Premier League and FA — End Gender-Based Violence in Football | Level Up"
  description="Level Up campaigns for the Premier League and FA to take a stand against gender-based violence in football. Take action now."
  ogImage="/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-02-05-a-las-01.22.34.png"
>
  <Header heroBg="loud-lilac" />

  <SplitHero
    bg="loud-lilac"
    imageSrc="/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-02-05-a-las-01.22.34.png"
    imageAlt="Premier League and FA campaign"
  >
    <Label color="electric-yellow">Gender-Based Violence</Label>
    <Headline color="off-white">Premier League and FA</Headline>
    <p style="color: var(--color-off-white); max-width: 46ch;">Let's end the culture of gender-based violence in football.</p>
    <Button bg="electric-yellow" text="navy" href="https://levelup.yourmovement.org/p/join-us" label="Take action" />
  </SplitHero>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <Headline as="h2">Premier League and FA</Headline>
    <p style="max-width: 68ch;">Let's end the culture of gender-based violence in football.</p>
    <p style="max-width: 68ch;">Over the past year, several players from different clubs have been charged with sexual violence. There is no process for how these cases are dealt with, and no recognition of the culture that contributes to gender-based violence. It's time for the Premier League and the Football Association to break the silence, take accountability and change the culture on gender-based violence in football, and enforce a policy for players who are suspected of causing harm.</p>
    <p style="max-width: 68ch;">As long as the Premier League protects players, this culture of impunity will persist. Several survivors have already come forward to share their experiences of assault from footballers, and what needs to change.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="navy">
    <div class="pl-support-cta">
      <Headline as="h2" color="off-white">Support this campaign</Headline>
      <div class="pl-support-cta-actions">
        <Button bg="electric-yellow" text="navy" href="/donate" label="Donate" />
        <Button bg="off-white" text="navy" href="https://levelup.yourmovement.org/p/join-us" label="Join us" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="navy">
    <div class="pl-join-cta">
      <Headline as="h2" color="off-white">Join the Level Up community</Headline>
      <p style="color: var(--color-off-white); max-width: 480px; margin-inline: auto;">Campaign updates, event invitations, and feminist thinking.</p>
      <Button bg="gentle-lilac" text="navy" href="https://levelup.yourmovement.org/p/join-us" label="Join us" />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Footer bg="loud-lilac" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .pl-support-cta, .pl-join-cta { text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .pl-support-cta-actions { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
</style>
